{"entries":{"0":{"uid":0,"key":["多余","变异","变化","突发","异位","异常"],"keysecondary":[],"comment":"畸位阴茎","content":"名称:畸位阴茎\n\n描述:在身体意外的部位(如手、嘴、尾巴等)长出至少一个阴茎。注:触手和乳头阴茎不符合要求。\n\n表现:除正常的阴茎位置外,手掌、背部或指间长出阴茎;嘴里能伸出阴茎;臀部、尾椎处等部位也可能出现功能完整的阴茎。这些额外的阴茎同样具有勃起射精的功能。","constant":false,"selective":true,"selectiveLogic":0,"addMemo":true,"order":100,"position":0,"disable":false,"excludeRecursion":false,"probability":100,"useProbability":true,"displayIndex":0,"depth":4},"1":{"uid":1,"key":["多余","变异","变化","突发","异位","异常"],"keysecondary":[],"comment":"畸位阴道","content":"名称: 畸位阴道\n\n描述:在身体意外的部位(如手、嘴、胸部等)长出阴道。\n\n表现:除正常的阴道位置外,手掌或指间会出现阴道;嘴角或舌头上有阴道;乳房、腹部、后背等部位也可能出现功能完整的阴道。这些额外的阴道同样具有分泌液体和接纳插入的功能。","constant":false,"selective":true,"selectiveLogic":0,"addMemo":true,"order":100,"position":0,"disable":false,"excludeRecursion":false,"probability":100,"useProbability":true,"displayIndex":1,"depth":4},"2":{"uid":2,"key":["截肢","断手","断臂","断腿","截瘫","残疾"],"keysecondary":[],"comment":"截肢","content":"名称:截肢\n\n描述:缺失一个或多个肢体的人。\n\n表现:手臂、腿部等肢体被截断,显示明显的断肢。肢体可能在以下膝盖或手肘的任何部位断开,造成残缺。","constant":false,"selective":true,"selectiveLogic":0,"addMemo":true,"order":100,"position":0,"disable":false,"excludeRecursion":false,"probability":100,"useProbability":true,"displayIndex":2,"depth":4},"3":{"uid":3,"key":["健壮","壮汉","肌肉","健美","健硕","强壮","大块头"],"keysecondary":[],"comment":"大肌肉","content":"名称:大肌肉\n\n描述:明显的大肌肉。肌肉发达的手臂必须和头部一样粗,或者肌肉发达的大腿必须是头部1.5倍粗。\n\n表现:手臂粗壮有力,大腿强健有劲,肌肉线条分明,块垒分明。肌肉虬结,充满爆发力。","constant":false,"selective":true,"selectiveLogic":0,"addMemo":true,"order":100,"position":0,"disable":false,"excludeRecursion":false,"probability":100,"useProbability":true,"displayIndex":3,"depth":4},"4":{"uid":4,"key":["机械","仿生","改造","植入","安装","移植","外科"],"keysecondary":[],"comment":"身体改造","content":"名称:身体改造\n\n描述:以某种人工方式改变身体的一部分,例如使用非有机增强、添加或移除身体部件以及不寻常的身体部件放置。\n\n表现:在身体上安装各种仿生装置、植入物和外科改造。或进行各种增强、移除甚至移植手术,创造一个修改或嵌入了非生物部件的身体。","constant":false,"selective":true,"selectiveLogic":0,"addMemo":true,"order":100,"position":0,"disable":false,"excludeRecursion":false,"probability":100,"useProbability":true,"displayIndex":4,"depth":4},"5":{"uid":5,"key":["双头","三头","多头","异形","融合","共用身体"],"keysecondary":[],"comment":"连体","content":"描述:两个或多个头共享同一个身体。\n\n表现:一个身体连接2个或以上的头颅,共同控制这个身体的行动。头与头之间通过脖子相连,共享心脏、四肢等器官。各个头拥有独立的思考。","constant":false,"selective":true,"selectiveLogic":0,"addMemo":true,"order":100,"position":0,"disable":false,"excludeRecursion":false,"probability":100,"useProbability":true,"displayIndex":5,"depth":4},"6":{"uid":6,"key":["关节","球形","旋转","玩具","人偶","娃娃"],"keysecondary":[],"comment":"关节娃娃","content":"名称:关节娃娃\n\n描述:有明显的圆形或插座式的关节。\n\n表现:手肘、膝盖等四肢关节呈球形或插座式,能够任意旋转。关节活动灵活,可自由活动,像可动人偶一样。","constant":false,"selective":true,"selectiveLogic":0,"addMemo":true,"order":100,"position":0,"disable":false,"excludeRecursion":false,"probability":100,"useProbability":true,"displayIndex":6,"depth":4},"7":{"uid":7,"key":["化身","人型","拟人","兽耳","角色扮演","人形","人形化"],"keysecondary":[],"comment":"拟人化","content":"名称:拟人化\n\n描述:原本不具有人形的角色获得了人形或完全人形化的形态。也可以接受角色扮演非人形角色的造型。\n\n表现:动物或非人形生物化身为人形角色。兽耳少女,猫娘,以及任何动物穿着制服或人类日常服饰的形象。保留了原本角色的特征,但外形基本人形化。","constant":false,"selective":true,"selectiveLogic":0,"addMemo":true,"order":100,"position":0,"disable":false,"excludeRecursion":false,"probability":100,"useProbability":true,"displayIndex":7,"depth":4},"8":{"uid":8,"key":["隐身","透明","空气","无形","隐匿"],"keysecondary":[],"comment":"透明","content":"名称:透明\n\n描述:无法看见的参与者。\n\n表现:完全看不见该参与者的任何身体部位,仿佛一个虚无的存在。声音和身体接触仍然存在。","constant":false,"selective":true,"selectiveLogic":0,"addMemo":true,"order":100,"position":0,"disable":false,"excludeRecursion":false,"probability":100,"useProbability":true,"displayIndex":8,"depth":4},"9":{"uid":9,"key":["多手","多臂","四臂","多任务"],"keysecondary":[],"comment":"多臂","content":"名称:多臂\n\n描述:一个人拥有多于两只手臂。\n\n表现:除了正常的两只手臂外,背部、腹部或其他部位还存在额外的手臂。这些多余的手臂与正常手臂功能相同。","constant":false,"selective":true,"selectiveLogic":0,"addMemo":true,"order":100,"position":0,"disable":false,"excludeRecursion":false,"probability":100,"useProbability":true,"displayIndex":9,"depth":4},"10":{"uid":10,"key":["多乳","多奶","母乳","喷奶","丰满","胸部"],"keysecondary":[],"comment":"多乳房","content":"名称:多乳房\n\n描述:单个角色上拥有2个以上的乳房。\n\n表现:胸部存在3对或更多对对称分布的乳房。多出的乳房与正常乳房大小和外观一致,同样具有分泌母乳的功能。","constant":false,"selective":true,"selectiveLogic":0,"addMemo":true,"order":100,"position":0,"disable":false,"excludeRecursion":false,"probability":100,"useProbability":true,"displayIndex":10,"depth":4},"11":{"uid":11,"key":["多奶头","牛奶","喷奶","分泌","母乳"],"keysecondary":[],"comment":"多乳头","content":"名称:多乳头\n\n描述:每个乳房上存在多个乳头,超过一个。包括乳牛状的乳房。\n\n表现:单侧乳房上存在2个或更多乳头。乳头按照对称分布或乱序排布。所有乳头均可产乳。","constant":false,"selective":true,"selectiveLogic":0,"addMemo":true,"order":100,"position":0,"disable":false,"excludeRecursion":false,"probability":100,"useProbability":true,"displayIndex":11,"depth":4},"12":{"uid":12,"key":["双头","多棒","交配","双重","多重"],"keysecondary":[],"comment":"多阴茎","content":"名称:多阴茎\n\n描述:拥有一个以上的阴茎。不包括触手状的阴茎。\n\n表现:一个生殖器上存在两个或更多独立工作的阴茎。所有阴茎均可勃起、插入、射精。","constant":false,"selective":true,"selectiveLogic":0,"addMemo":true,"order":100,"position":0,"disable":false,"excludeRecursion":false,"probability":100,"useProbability":true,"displayIndex":12,"depth":4},"13":{"uid":13,"key":["双穴","多穴","双重","多重"],"keysecondary":[],"comment":"多阴道","content":"名称:多阴道\n\n描述:拥有一个以上的阴道。\n\n表现:一个会阴处存在两个或更多能够独立工作、具有正常功能的阴道。","constant":false,"selective":true,"selectiveLogic":0,"addMemo":true,"order":100,"position":0,"disable":false,"excludeRecursion":false,"probability":100,"useProbability":true,"displayIndex":13,"depth":4},"14":{"uid":14,"key":["健美","壮汉","肌肉","力量","健壮","强壮"],"keysecondary":[],"comment":"肌肉","content":"名称:肌肉\n\n描述:肌肉明显发达的参与者。\n\n表现:肌肉线条清晰可见,手臂粗壮,胸肌饱满,腹肌结实,大腿强健有力。","constant":false,"selective":true,"selectiveLogic":0,"addMemo":true,"order":100,"position":0,"disable":false,"excludeRecursion":false,"probability":100,"useProbability":true,"displayIndex":14,"depth":4},"15":{"uid":15,"key":["增肌","增长","鼓起","壮大","硬挺","鼓胀","爆发"],"keysecondary":[],"comment":"肌肉增长","content":"名称:肌肉增长\n\n描述:在原本没有的部位出现肌肉,或原有肌肉变得肿大。\n\n表现:四肢及躯干的肌肉迅速鼓胀生长,变得强壮发达。肌肉暴涨,充满极致的力量感。","constant":false,"selective":true,"selectiveLogic":0,"addMemo":true,"order":100,"position":0,"disable":false,"excludeRecursion":false,"probability":100,"useProbability":true,"displayIndex":15,"depth":4},"16":{"uid":16,"key":["孕妇","孕肚","怀孕","待产","分娩","胎儿"],"keysecondary":[],"comment":"怀孕","content":"名称:怀孕\n\n描述:涉及显然怀孕的参与者的性活动或裸体。\n\n表现:裸体展示或性爱时,孕肚高高隆起,丰满圆润。强调大肚子和其他孕期身体特征。分娩时的精彩画面。","constant":false,"selective":true,"selectiveLogic":0,"addMemo":true,"order":100,"position":0,"disable":false,"excludeRecursion":false,"probability":100,"useProbability":true,"displayIndex":16,"depth":4},"17":{"uid":17,"key":["塑形","几何","融化","扁平"],"keysecondary":[],"comment":"平面化","content":"名称:平面化\n\n描述:参与者扁平化、融化或变形为某种几何形状,如球形或立方体。\n\n表现:人体部位逐渐塌陷变形,最终整个身体形成气球、软泥一般。也可以变硬成为各种立体几何图形。","constant":false,"selective":true,"selectiveLogic":0,"addMemo":true,"order":100,"position":0,"disable":false,"excludeRecursion":false,"probability":100,"useProbability":true,"displayIndex":17,"depth":4},"18":{"uid":18,"key":["伸长","延展","超伸","抻长","橡皮"],"keysecondary":[],"comment":"拉伸","content":"名称:拉伸\n\n描述:伸展肢体超越正常人类能力的极限。\n\n表现:手臂、腿部等肢体被伸展到不可能的长度,超过正常人体骨骼肌肉限制,类似橡皮人。","constant":false,"selective":true,"selectiveLogic":0,"addMemo":true,"order":100,"position":0,"disable":false,"excludeRecursion":false,"probability":100,"useProbability":true,"displayIndex":18,"depth":4},"19":{"uid":19,"key":["尾巴","尾交","刺激","缠绕","蹭动","撸动"],"keysecondary":[],"comment":"尾交","content":"名称:尾交\n\n描述:使用尾巴刺激生殖部位。\n\n表现: 使用尾巴缠绕套弄阴茎,或插入阴道和肛门进行抽插。靠尾巴的挑逗达到高潮。","constant":false,"selective":true,"selectiveLogic":0,"addMemo":true,"order":100,"position":0,"disable":false,"excludeRecursion":false,"probability":100,"useProbability":true,"displayIndex":19,"depth":4},"20":{"uid":20,"key":["翅膀","翅交","抚摸","羽毛","扇动","撩拨","抚慰"],"keysecondary":[],"comment":"翅交","content":"名称:翅交\n\n描述:使用翅膀刺激生殖部位。\n\n表现:有翅膀的角色用翅膀抚弄,或是包裹住对方的性器。也可拍打臀部。翅膀柔软的触感增强愉悦。","constant":false,"selective":true,"selectiveLogic":0,"addMemo":true,"order":100,"position":0,"disable":false,"excludeRecursion":false,"probability":100,"useProbability":true,"displayIndex":20,"depth":4},"21":{"uid":21,"key":["天使","恶魔","羽翼","飞行","翅膀","羽毛"],"keysecondary":[],"comment":"翅膀","content":"名称:翅膀\n\n描述:任何长在类人身上的明显翅膀。\n\n表现:肩胛处、腰部或手臂处长出巨大有力的翅膀,能够飞行或造成足够空气扇动。翅膀具有完整结构,长有层叠的羽毛。能够飞行。","constant":false,"selective":true,"selectiveLogic":0,"addMemo":true,"order":100,"position":0,"disable":false,"excludeRecursion":false,"probability":100,"useProbability":true,"displayIndex":21,"depth":4}}}